    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know about a new direction... that's what i keep telling myself but the fog is just too thick. it feels less like a detour and more like the world simply ran out of road for me. if the path ends here, maybe it's because there's nothing left to see or be anyway. it feels so quiet and final at the edge.",
